    bootstrap_stage2_admission_refused_by_concurrent_source_edits_2026-09-05, 1, "CLOSED (stale/by-design 2026-11-03): the bug body itself states Stage 2 passed and the gate (bootstrap-from-scratch.sh admission predicate, requires byte-identical source-inputs before/after) behaved correctly; the cause was another session editing the shared checkout. Current policy forbids that: .spipe/policy/vcs.sdn requires unique_workspace + main_worktree read_only, and bootstrap lanes use isolated worktrees. No compiler/script defect to fix; refusing on a mutated source tree is the intended fail-closed behavior."

